Description:
 niaos-root-preparation - Internal NiaOS root preparation service
Changes:
 niaos-root-preparation (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * Reinspect explicitly frozen roots against retained archives without writes.
   * Bind fresh observations to the mount and inode under the caller reservation.
   * Require complete namespaces, exact xattrs and declared inode link groups.
